{
  "$schema": "https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json",
  "version": "2.1.0",
  "runs": [
    {
      "tool": {
        "driver": {
          "name": "ai-rulez",
          "version": "1.2.3",
          "informationUri": "https://github.com/Goldziher/ai-rulez",
          "rules": [
            {
              "id": "AR001",
              "name": "secret-detected",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "secret-detected"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "a credential pattern (cloud key, token, private key or a configured pattern) appears in content or a script"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "a credential pattern (cloud key, token, private key or a configured pattern) appears in content or a script.\nA credential committed into instructions or scripts is readable by everyone with repository access and is sent to the model provider with the prompt.\nBad: `export AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE` in a skill script\nGood: Read the value from the environment: `aws sts get-caller-identity` with credentials from the shell",
                "markdown": "**a credential pattern (cloud key, token, private key or a configured pattern) appears in content or a script**\n\nA credential committed into instructions or scripts is readable by everyone with repository access and is sent to the model provider with the prompt.\n\n- Bad: `export AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE` in a skill script\n- Good: Read the value from the environment: `aws sts get-caller-identity` with credentials from the shell\n\n[Documentation](https://goldziher.github.io/ai-rulez/strict-validation/#ar001-secret-detected)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://goldziher.github.io/ai-rulez/strict-validation/#ar001-secret-detected",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "properties": {
                "analyzer": "security",
                "scope": "file",
                "security-severity": "8.0",
                "tags": [
                  "security",
                  "ai-instructions"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "AR202",
              "name": "anchor-unresolved",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "anchor-unresolved"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "a markdown link anchor matches no heading in the target"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "a markdown link anchor matches no heading in the target.\nThe target file exists but has no heading producing the anchor, so the link lands at the top of the file.\nBad: `[setup](README.md#setup)` when the heading is now \"Installation\"\nGood: `[setup](README.md#installation)`",
                "markdown": "**a markdown link anchor matches no heading in the target**\n\nThe target file exists but has no heading producing the anchor, so the link lands at the top of the file.\n\n- Bad: `[setup](README.md#setup)` when the heading is now \"Installation\"\n- Good: `[setup](README.md#installation)`\n\n[Documentation](https://goldziher.github.io/ai-rulez/strict-validation/#ar202-anchor-unresolved)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://goldziher.github.io/ai-rulez/strict-validation/#ar202-anchor-unresolved",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "analyzer": "references",
                "scope": "file",
                "tags": [
                  "quality",
                  "ai-instructions",
                  "references"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "AR401",
              "name": "path-missing",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "path-missing"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "a backticked repo path does not exist"
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "a backticked repo path does not exist.\nA backticked repository path that does not exist is stale guidance that misleads the model.\nBad: `Edit src/old_module/api.py` after the module moved\nGood: Update the path, or list generated paths in lint.allow_paths",
                "markdown": "**a backticked repo path does not exist**\n\nA backticked repository path that does not exist is stale guidance that misleads the model.\n\n- Bad: `Edit src/old_module/api.py` after the module moved\n- Good: Update the path, or list generated paths in lint.allow_paths\n\n[Documentation](https://goldziher.github.io/ai-rulez/strict-validation/#ar401-path-missing)"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://goldziher.github.io/ai-rulez/strict-validation/#ar401-path-missing",
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "warning"
              },
              "properties": {
                "analyzer": "references",
                "scope": "file",
                "tags": [
                  "quality",
                  "ai-instructions",
                  "references"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "AR001",
          "ruleIndex": 0,
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "AWS access key id AKIA**** found"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": ".ai-rulez/rules/a%20b.md",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 7
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "aiRulezFingerprint/v1": "ar1:aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa"
          },
          "properties": {
            "security-severity": "8.0"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "AR401",
          "ruleIndex": 2,
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "path \"src/x.go\" does not exist | really,\nreally"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": ".ai-rulez/skills/s/SKILL.md",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 12
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "aiRulezFingerprint/v1": "ar1:bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "AR202",
          "ruleIndex": 1,
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "no heading produces #x"
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "README.md",
                  "uriBaseId": "%SRCROOT%"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 3
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "partialFingerprints": {
            "aiRulezFingerprint/v1": "ar1:cccccccccccccccccccccccc"
          }
        }
      ],
      "invocations": [
        {
          "executionSuccessful": true
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
